factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 8 problems
  The reel_script says the attack on the wife happened 'நேற்று முன்தினம்' (the day before yesterday) and places the complaint/visit in sequence; the article only says he attacked her 'நேற்று முன்தினம்' which matches, so this is fine — however, the reel_script omits the fact that the wife (சாந்தி) is the one who filed the complaint with police, which it does include; no issue there.
  The caption says Shanthi's age (24) is part of the phrase 'தனது மனைவி சாந்தி, 24 வயது, பெயரில் கடன் வாங்கியிருந்தார்', which wrongly attributes the loan to Shanthi's name as if she were the borrower in a grammatically confused way; the article says Mohankumar borrowed the loan in his wife's name, so the caption wrongly states that 'இவர் தனது மனைவி சாந்தி பெயரில் கடன் வாங்கியிருந்தார்' with the age inserted mid-clause, creating an unclear sentence.
  The caption says Mohankumar was 'தினக்கூலி வேலை செய்பவர்' and the article agrees, but the caption and reel_script both state the complaint was filed by Shanthi, which matches the article; no issue.
  The reel_script says Shanthi was pressing him to repay the loan 'கடனைக் கட்டச் சொல்லி மனைவி சாந்தி, 24 வயது, வற்புறுத்தியதால்' – the age is inserted between subject and verb, making the sentence ungrammatical/unclear in Tamil.
  The reel_script and caption say the attack was 'நேற்று முன்தினம்' on the wife but the reel_script's 'அவரைத் தாக்கினார்' is consistent; however the slides say 'கடனைக் கட்டச் சொன்ன மனைவி சாந்தியைத் தாக்கினார்' which is consistent with the article.
  The slides_spec line 'மோகன்குமார் மனைவி பெயரில் கடன் வாங்கினார்' is consistent with the article; however the slide 'சாந்தி, 24 வயது, மணப்பாறை போலீசில் புகார் அளித்தார்' places the age in a way that is acceptable.
  The reel_script omits that the injured man was rescued by police and bystanders while the article says both; the reel_script does include this, so no omission.
  The caption's line 'நேரம்: நேற்று மாலை' is consistent with the article's 'நேற்று மாலை'.
